# Binaries the project compares byte for byte. Auto-detection already gets these
# right (they are full of NULs), but this repo's whole method is byte-exact
# round trips against the Nextion Editor's output — a line-ending conversion
# slipping into a .zi or a .tft would corrupt the evidence, not just a file.
*.zi binary
*.tft binary
*.HMI binary
*.png binary
*.bin binary

# A generated project is read by the byte offsets its first line gives
# (berry/panel_runtime.be): an end-of-line conversion on checkout would move
# every line after it, and the panel would refuse the file.
*.jsonl text eol=lf

# The brain's Berry, compiled into the firmware: Tasmota's solidification takes
# the class name as the rest of the `#@ solidify:` line, carriage return
# included, and a `Brain\r` breaks the build's modules.h (a checkout with
# core.autocrlf).
*.be text eol=lf
